# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_fire): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Fire_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). FP_Entrance with the clearance and the entry item gone: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/Fire_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfFire
login
trade FP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfFire x1  # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                   # the fight, arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Fire_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Fire_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -720.631,-1.4,-597.955 CloisterOfFlames
trigger FP_Entrance                     # the clearance, the entry item gone: the default
